        <div id="post-1395" class="post-1395 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized tag-agile">

          <div class="post-header">
           <h3 class="post-title"><a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/2013/03/release-cadence-youre-not-agile-if-youre-not-shipping/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: Release Cadence: You&rsquo;re Not Agile If You&rsquo;re Not Shipping">Release Cadence: You&rsquo;re Not Agile If You&rsquo;re Not Shipping</a></h3>
           <p class="post-date">
            <span class="month">Mar</span>
            <span class="day">8</span>
           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/category/uncategorized/" title="View all posts in Uncategorized" rel="category tag">Uncategorized</a> | <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/2013/03/release-cadence-youre-not-agile-if-youre-not-shipping/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on Release Cadence: You&rsquo;re Not Agile If You&rsquo;re Not Shipping"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="1395 http://cromwellhaus.com/?p=1395">No Comments</span></a>              </span>
           </p>
          </div>

          <div class="post-content clearfix">
