          <div class="post-header">
           <h3 class="post-title"><a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/2013/01/creating-an-offline-web-platform-installer-for-service-bus-1-0/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: Creating an Offline Web Platform Installer for Service Bus 1.0">Creating an Offline Web Platform Installer for Service Bus 1.0</a></h3>
           <p class="post-date">
            <span class="month">Jan</span>
            <span class="day">2</span>
           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/category/uncategorized/" title="View all posts in Uncategorized" rel="category tag">Uncategorized</a> | <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/2013/01/creating-an-offline-web-platform-installer-for-service-bus-1-0/#comments" class="comments"  title="Comment on Creating an Offline Web Platform Installer for Service Bus 1.0"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="1386 http://cromwellhaus.com/?p=1386">1 Comment</span></a>              </span>
