          <p>One of my clients is evaluating a number of Service Bus tools.&#160; One of those includes the Azure Service Bus which is now available for on-premise deployment. Service Bus 1.0 is available only through Web Platform Installer at this time and it’s not readily apparent how you might use WPI for a network isolated environment.&#160; [...]</p>

