           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/category/uncategorized/" title="View all posts in Uncategorized" rel="category tag">Uncategorized</a> | <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/2012/10/adaptive-problems-require-responding-to-change-over-following-a-plan/#comments" class="comments"  title="Comment on Adaptive Problems Require Responding to Change Over Following a Plan"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="1364 http://cromwellhaus.com/?p=1364">2 Comments</span></a>              </span>
